Read-only project audit. repro.c copies the actual proto2 scheduler block unchanged from latency_main.c:175-208. Only MCU registers/time/UART are replaced by deterministic host functions. Real ClosedLoopRadio_Feed/Take are linked with CL_F4_SOFT_LAND. The input holds F4 throughout and pulses F3 for 20ms between UART frames. This verifies software control flow, not RF latency or hardware.
